<strong>Visual Splendor:</strong> Immerse yourself in stunning visuals and atmospheric landscapes, bringing the ancient world to life with unparalleled beauty and depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Choices:</strong> Navigate moral dilemmas and ethical quandaries as you strive to find your way through the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a time long forgotten, when the world was still young and newly sung into form by the Gods, humanity lived gently within nature’s pulse. They moved with the tides, the seasons, and the shifting winds — yet unlike the other creatures, they were fragile. They had no claws for defence, no fur for warmth, no wings to escape the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeing this, the Gods gathered with the spirits of ocean and mountain, plant and animal, and forged a sacred pact. Each being would offer humanity a gift — warmth, shelter, food, guidance — and in return humans would honour and protect the balance of the world. Thus the first totems were given, and the bond between humans and the living land was set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the Gods saw a deeper truth. Humanity carried within them a spark none of the other beings had: the gift of the mind — the ability to imagine, remember, reason. A gift bright enough to build worlds… or to break them. They knew that if the mind ever drifted free from nature’s rhythm, it could lead the people astray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So the Gods gave Fire — not only to warm and cook, but as a living presence, a guide, a ritual tether to keep the mind balanced with the breath of the earth. And they asked the Dragon, eldest of the ancient beings, to watch over what humans could not carry. The Dragon agreed to hold the deepest secrets of a good life — to guard them in the dark, and return them if humanity ever forgot the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a long age, the pact held. Dragons roamed the skies, spirits walked openly, and humans lived in harmony, guided by ritual and flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But epochs passed. Memories faded. Power whispered. Rituals were abandoned, Fire was taken for granted, and the mind — unanchored — wandered into jealousy and greed. The old beings withdrew into myth, waiting for a time when they would be needed again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As imbalance spread, nature rose in warning: winds that tore, floods that reshaped valleys, Fire that cleansed. From this upheaval, a new age dawned — one of uncertainty, but also of possibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in this era of renewal, echoes of the old pact return in the dreams of a chosen few. Drawn to a land where the presence of the Gods still lingers, guided by the quiet voice of Fire, you are one of these seekers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dragon sleeps, but its promise remains.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let Fire light your way as you journey to awaken what was forgotten — and rediscover the secrets of living in harmony with a world that still remembers you.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totemic animal powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream-guided exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient language puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival &amp; foraging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather &amp; environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/23bf009f04927ed53e315e2472a37b64.poster.avif?t=1783521550\" width=960 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/23bf009f04927ed53e315e2472a37b64.webm?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/23bf009f04927ed53e315e2472a37b64.mp4?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a living wilderness shaped by myth, nature, and forgotten history. In <strong>FIRE: The First Dreamer</strong>, survival and discovery go hand in hand as you roam forests, mountains, caves, and ancient ruins scattered across a vast sacred landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, forage, and learn to live with the rhythms of the land while defending yourself from the predators that share it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/93ad04f9df547167b6f37fd09b2d07c7.poster.avif?t=1783521550\" width=960 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/93ad04f9df547167b6f37fd09b2d07c7.webm?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/93ad04f9df547167b6f37fd09b2d07c7.mp4?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fire Guides the Dreamer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire is more than warmth or light. It is a guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through dreams and visions, Fire reveals hidden paths, ancient memories, and glimpses of the Dragon’s wisdom. Those who listen carefully may discover truths long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/c0c86a3aff334e443418ea3c1dfb384d.poster.avif?t=1783521550\" width=920 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/c0c86a3aff334e443418ea3c1dfb384d.webm?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/c0c86a3aff334e443418ea3c1dfb384d.mp4?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Totemic Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey you will encounter totem animals — ancient spirits tied to the land itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each offers gifts that aid survival, hunting, exploration, and the uncovering of deeper mysteries hidden within the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/ad2f13ab8e8c226f4377230644f2bf03.poster.avif?t=1783521550\" width=920 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/ad2f13ab8e8c226f4377230644f2bf03.webm?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/ad2f13ab8e8c226f4377230644f2bf03.mp4?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ancient Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symbols carved into stone hold the language of those who came before. By learning to read these markings you will unlock hidden knowledge and solve environmental puzzles woven throughout the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/6a264840fc74bcf22ce1c0eae15fd0bf.poster.avif?t=1783521550\" width=920 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/6a264840fc74bcf22ce1c0eae15fd0bf.webm?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/6a264840fc74bcf22ce1c0eae15fd0bf.mp4?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nightmares</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance must be maintained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When harmony is broken the dream fractures, and Nightmares emerge — brief but haunting encounters that challenge your resolve and threaten the path ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/5148219988022dcef8fd671b36012e82.poster.avif?t=1783521550\" width=920 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/5148219988022dcef8fd671b36012e82.webm?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/5148219988022dcef8fd671b36012e82.mp4?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather, daylight, and the natural rhythms of the wilderness shape your journey. Winds sweep across the hills, fires crackle in the dark, and the land itself seems to breathe around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/6819ad5b4814569b821af8df37da4274.poster.avif?t=1783521550\" width=920 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/6819ad5b4814569b821af8df37da4274.webm?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/6819ad5b4814569b821af8df37da4274.mp4?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Myth and Spirit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragons, spirits, and ancestral whispers echo across the Preseli mountains, guiding those who listen carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path of the Dreamer is not simply one of survival — it is a journey toward restoring balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/7bbdedb5470013fbf509ba285ba3255d.poster.avif?t=1783521550\" width=920 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/7bbdedb5470013fbf509ba285ba3255d.webm?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/extras/7bbdedb5470013fbf509ba285ba3255d.mp4?t=1783521550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Uncover ancient secrets, summon totemic magic, decode enigmatic messages, and explore the majestic Preseli mountains of Wales in this open world adventure inspired by a true story. Dare to embark on this journey and rediscover the lost secrets of a life lived with purpose and meaning!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/d009565ed45a866ac02ae8eec0f20953b22aa375/header.jpg?t=1783521550", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/4392b34afba465520ed60698b2f8bd9205428c38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783521550", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136420/4392b34afba465520ed60698b2f8bd9205428c38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783521550", "website": "https://